cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "living-contract-diff: check your OpenAPI spec against what your API actually returns"
version: 0.3
date-released: 2026-11-14
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/living-contract-diff"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/living-contract-diff"
abstract: >-
  Learns what an API actually returns from recorded traffic (a HAR file or a
  folder of JSON samples), builds a statistics-only observed contract, and
  diffs it against the declared OpenAPI 3.x spec to report drift. Static
  analysis only; nothing is executed.
keywords:
  - OpenAPI
  - API
  - contract testing
  - HAR
  - drift
